{"source_id": "C025:p003:s0004:c0003:t0104", "parent_source_id": "C025:p003:s0004:c0003", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_count": 4, "book": "本草求真", "heading": "六淫病症主藥", "source_path": "C/C025.txt", "text": "是以風痛之症。多見周身骨節疼痛。\n\n故藥有不離乎羌活防風桂枝獨活山甲白花蛇烏蛇白附子石南藤川烏附天雄。", "target_original": "本草求真(C025)/003-下編.md", "translation_chunk_index": 104, "translation_chunk_count": 107, "sentence_count": 3}
